WEBVTT

00:03:56.775 --> 00:04:00.169
while the brave one
gets in the ring and engages

00:04:00.943 --> 00:04:05.400
and gets bloody and gets dirty and fails
over and over and over again,

00:04:05.424 --> 00:04:10.146
but yet isn't afraid and isn't timid
and lives life in a bold way."

00:04:10.944 --> 00:04:13.377
And so of course I want to make it across.

00:04:13.401 --> 00:04:18.244
It is the goal, and I should
be so shallow to say that this year,

00:04:18.673 --> 00:04:22.174
the destination was even sweeter
than the journey.

00:04:22.198 --> 00:04:24.101
(Laughter)

00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:27.533
(Applause)

00:04:27.557 --> 00:04:29.934
But the journey itself
was worthwhile taking.